cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this software or its results, please cite it using the metadata
  below, and also cite the PTB-XL dataset (Wagner et al., 2020) on which all
  models and results are based.
type: software
title: "Reduced Leads: Diagnosis-Specific Selective Prediction for Safe Reduced-Lead ECG AI"
abstract: >-
  A research framework that trains lead-aware transformer models on PTB-XL,
  evaluates them under reduced-lead inputs, and converts calibrated scores into
  diagnosis-specific trust / acquire-12-lead / expert-review actions with
  patient-level risk control and locked test audits.
